      "matters": "ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE FOR CHANGE OF NAME<br>Off Calendar Oct-20-2005 Granted Per Written Order<br>MINI MINUTES: This cause came on regularly as scheduled for OSC hearing for Change of Name of a Minor.<br>Commissioner: Sue Kaplan, Clerk: S. Ravinantapricha, CSR: Tony Vaughn.<br>Petitioners: Hui Qiong Zhang and Sek Man Fund, present in pro per as Guardian ad litem for and with the Minor: Zhuo Jun Feng, and with Cantonese Interpreter: Erik Fung.<br>Petitioners and Interpreter were sworn and examined.<br>No objections to the proposed change of name were made at the hearing.<br>It appears to the satisfaction of the Court that all the allegations in the petition are true, correct, and sufficient and that the petition should be granted.<br>The Court grants the petition for Change of Name of a Minor to: Erik Fung.<br>Decree signed in open court.<br><br>",
